          "bodyMarkdown": "## Superfluous trailing arguments\n\nSuperfluous argument passed to <a class=\"Link\" href=\"/splrad/steward/blob/500311a4ccfed739b9ffe7e1091684943a944979/packages/runner/src/release-pipeline.ts#L258-L261\">function assertProductDelivery</a>.\n\n---\n\nTo fix this, remove the superfluous second argument from the <code>assertProductDelivery</code> call in <code>scripts/manual-candidate.mjs</code>.</p>\n<p>Best fix without changing functionality:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In <code>validateManualCandidate</code>, keep parsing delivery as-is.</li>\n<li>Change <code>assertProductDelivery(delivery, product.name);</code> to <code>assertProductDelivery(delivery);</code>.</li>\n<li>No imports, helper methods, or additional definitions are needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This aligns the call with the function’s expected parameters and eliminates the ignored argument CodeQL reported.",
